OL,3,ABadenoch accuses Burnham of kicking
OL,4,Adefence spending into the long grass
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has
OL,7,Faccused the prime minister of "kicking
OL,8,Fdefence spending into the long grass"
OL,9,Fas she set out Tory plans to push the
OL,10,Ffigure to 3% of GDP by 2030.
OL,12,FBadenoch said a Conservative government
OL,13,Fwould fund the commitment, worth #10bn
OL,14,Fa year, through measures including
OL,15,Freimposing the two-child benefit cap,
OL,16,Freforming housing benefit and ending
OL,17,FVAT exemptions for Motability cars.
OL,19,FPointing to the threat from countries
OL,20,Flike Russia and Iran, Badenoch told a
OL,21,Fpress conference: "Conflict is coming,
OL,22,Fwe must act now."
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
